// its-in-your-head icon set v1.9 — single-stroke 16x16, tintable (currentColor only;
// "on" state adds accent + glow, "off" stays muted flat).
// Source of truth: each icon = SVG path segments on a 16x16 viewBox.
// History: v1.3 crystal portrait family -> v1.5 pencil-sketch-in-frame (owner-accepted)
// -> v1.8 = owner frozen state.
// v1.9 — owner spec pass (authorized):
//   - mirror: redefined as the MIRROR dropdown with the /mirror command list
//     (pulse | portrait | drift | context | adaptation on/off | reset).
//     Thin hand mirror; diagonal shine = menu open, no shine = closed.
//   - tabs (pulse / portrait / drift): flat style, for the minimized word-less menu.
//     Active state = accent highlight (TabButton border/tint), no separate off glyph.
//   - extract removed: it was my misread of "experimental mode" (prompt-injection
//     saturation). New pair: experimental_off = hollow circle, experimental = the same
//     circle with a core in the center (on).
//   - animation_off: plain play, no extra marks — off = uncolored/muted only.
//   - portrait_gen: marker iterated (corner cross -> star -> plus/spinner/refresh,
//     all rejected); now "shading pass": 3 pencil hatches under the jaw (on) /
//     single quiet hatch (off) — stays in the pencil language.
//   - feedback, repo, minimize, portrait family (frame/profile), pet family: untouched.
const IYH_ICONS = {
  // — tabs (flat style): for the minimized word-less menu; active tab = accent
  //   highlight (TabButton border/tint), no separate off glyph.
  pulse: ['M2 10 L5 10 L7 4 L9 14 L11 10 L14 10'],
  minimize: ['M3 12 H13', 'M6 8 L8 10 L10 8'],
